    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player starts the game near a pile of objects. You need to take the object with the left mouse button. Player need to carry this object around the location and find where to put it. The faster the player does this, the more points he gets. The player's task is to put all the objects in place to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a puzzle from the first person. In which the game is controlled by the character on the WASD and mouse, you need to look for objects and take them to their places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a 3D puzzle, transferring things to the right places to create a beautiful place.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a 3D puzzle, the player needs to put in place the missing pieces of the puzzle (items) scattered around the location. To create an entire location.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to go to the item, take it by pressing the left mouse button and take the item to the desired location marked in green. If you brought the correct item, it will snap into place and you will receive leaderboard points and achievements for this.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect as much items as possible as quickly as possible to get more points for the leaderboard.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you brought the wrong item, you can throw it away, it will return to the starting location so that you can pick it up again.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player starts the game near a pile of objects. You need to take the object with the left mouse button. Player need to carry this object around the location and find where to put it. The faster the player does this, the more points he gets. The player's task is to put all the objects in place to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a puzzle from the first person. In which the game is controlled by the character on the WASD and mouse, you need to look for objects and take them to their places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a 3D puzzle, transferring things to the right places to create a beautiful place.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a 3D puzzle, the player needs to put in place the missing pieces of the puzzle (items) scattered around the location. To create an entire location.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to go to the item, take it by pressing the left mouse button and take the item to the desired location marked in green. If you brought the correct item, it will snap into place and you will receive leaderboard points and achievements for this.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect as much items as possible as quickly as possible to get more points for the leaderboard.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you brought the wrong item, you can throw it away, it will return to the starting location so that you can pick it up again.</p>",
